{"change_summary":"Verified the pending shrimp-loop runtime amendments were already present in the current workspace, then tightened the regression coverage around them. I updated `crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs` unit tests to lock in oxygen-limited respiration routing and same-day carbonate-cache refresh before condition updates, and adjusted `crates/tank_core/tests/budget_tracking.rs` plus `crates/tank_core/tests/thermal_reproduction_penalty.rs` to seed `animal.reserve_g` explicitly so the suite remains consistent with reserve-only hatching and maturation.","outstanding_risks":["The untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory is still present in the worktree and was left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the four pending amendments against the current runtime and confirmed the production-path fixes were already present, leaving regression and fixture alignment as the remaining work in this turn.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Updated shrimp pathway tests to cover oxygen-limited respiration coupling and stale-carbonate-cache refresh behavior, and aligned reproduction fixtures with the reserve-only biomass funding rule.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran formatting plus targeted and full `tank_core` test passes to confirm the amended shrimp-loop behavior and fixture changes are green end to end.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib --test shrimp_population --test shrimp_feeding_pathway` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test thermal_reproduction_penalty` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core` passed."]}